---
import { CURRENT_VERSION, FOOTER_LINKS } from "../config";
---
<footer class="px-6 py-12 border-t border-neutral-200 dark:border-neutral-800">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
        <div class="space-y-4 text-xs text-neutral-400 dark:text-neutral-500">
            <nav class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
                {FOOTER_LINKS.map( item => <a href={item.href}>{item.text}</a>)}
            </nav>
            <div>以诚实、理性、尊重与开放为原则，书写中文互联网应有的文字与思想。</div>
            <div><a class="capitalize" href={`/guidelines/${CURRENT_VERSION}`}>active {CURRENT_VERSION}</a></div>
        </div>
    </div>
</footer>